{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationinternationalization\/listformatstyle"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that formats lists of items with a separator and conjunction appropriate for a given locale."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ListFormatStyle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Style","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Style","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FormatStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials11FormatStyleP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Style","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"FormatInput","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials11FormatStyleP0C5InputQa"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Style","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"FormatOutput","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials11FormatStyleP0C6OutputQa"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A list format style creates human readable text from a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" of values. Customize the formatting behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the list using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/width-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/listType-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/locale","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" properties. The system automatically caches unique"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configurations of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to enhance performance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use either ","type":"text"},{"code":"formatted()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"formatted(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", both instance methods of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", to create a string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"representation of the items.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"formatted()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method applies the default list format style to a sequence of strings. For example:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["[\"Kristin\", \"Paul\", \"Ana\", \"Bill\"].formatted()","\/\/ Kristin, Paul, Ana, and Bill"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can customize a list’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"width","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" properties.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/listType-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" property specifies the semantics of the list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/width-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" property determines the size of the returned string."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"formatted(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method applies a custom list format style. You can use the static factory method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"list(type:width:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to create a custom list format style as a parameter to the method.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This example formats a sequence with a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/ListType-swift.enum\/and"},{"type":"text","text":" list type and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/ListFormatStyle\/Width-swift.enum\/short"},{"type":"text","text":" width:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swif